1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:52,890
Giant Demon Clan

25
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,480
Ancestor,

26
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,560
what's wrong with you ?

27
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,680
I will take your body !

28
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,680
That demon child destroyed my body

29
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,360
and injured my Origin Soul.

30
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:25,600
If I hadn't lured him to the extreme north

31
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:29,000
to use the ancient restriction that is there,

32
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:31,680
I likely wouldn't have escaped this calamity.

33
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,560
Not only did I fail to capture Wang Lin

34
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,960
but I was also severely injured.

35
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:49,080
The only thing I obtained was this celestial sword.

36
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,040
Sword Spirit,

37
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,680
come out !

38
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,280
My lord, have mercy.

39
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,280
Please don't kill me.

40
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:02,960
I was forced by that person named Wang.

41
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:05,640
I also hate him to the bones...

42
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:10,120
You are certainly a strange Sword Spirit.

43
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:13,280
Most are very determined and loyal.

44
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,480
Your grandpa Xu...

45
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:20,890
How could those servant Sword Spirits compare to me ?

46
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:24,240
A wise man knows whom he should follow...

47
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:28,880
This sword is no ordinary object.

48
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:32,200
A Sword Spirit that possesses intelligence

49
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,560
is really rare.

50
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,360
It would be a pity

51
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:38,280
to erase it.

52
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:41,520
While my Origin Soul is merging with this body,

53
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,080
I will seal it

54
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:45,000
and see what happens.

55
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,730
Since you surrendered on your own...

56
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,280
From now on,

57
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,720
you shall be this old man's Sword Spirit.

58
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:57,280
Don't try to escape.

59
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,720
My lord, don't worry.

60
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:02,520
Xu Liguo has always been loyal.

61
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,520
I wouldn’t dare to betray you !

62
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,880
If I break this oath

63
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:07,080
let 10 000 demons pierce my heart !

64
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,640
You'll accompany me in seclusion.

65
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:13,680
When my Origin Soul is 50% merged with this body,

66
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:16,200
we will settle the score with Wang Lin !

67
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,240
Master !

68
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:29,120
When will you come to save me !?

69
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:34,880
They say the Soul Refining Sect is the most mysterious sect of Pilu.

70
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,120
They never actively recruit disciples,

71
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:39,690
they only take those willing to bite the bait.

72
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:42,360
As long as you pay the spirit stones on the opening day

73
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:44,800
you will get a cave for cultivation.

74
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:49,610
A sect protection formation...

75
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:52,280
Who dares trespass into our Soul Refining Sect !?

76
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:59,570
Hong Maozi
Soul Refining Sect's outer sect Elder
Early stage Core Formation

77
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,960
Greetings Senior,

78
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,890
Junior apologizes for intruding.

79
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,480
I've come to join the Soul Refining Sect.

80
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,680
Which sect are you from ?

81
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,360
Disciple is a rogue cultivator.

82
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:20,960
Reaching Foundation Establishment as a rogue isn't easy...

83
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:25,960
But our outer disciple recruitment period ended long ago.

84
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,280
Come back in a few years.

85
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,090
Senior, please wait !

86
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:32,290
This is a flying sword that Junior found a few years ago.

87
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,690
I've been saving it.

88
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,450
Please Senior, accept it.

89
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:43,440
How does this kid have such an artifact ?

90
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:48,080
Where did you find this ?

91
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:51,160
Many years ago, I helped a Core Formation cultivator.

92
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,810
I protected him while he recovered from an injury.

93
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:56,000
After recovering, he gifted me this sword.

94
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,160
But disciple's cultivation is too low

95
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,120
to use it.

96
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,160
Okay,

97
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,400
I can see that you worked hard,

98
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,960
so I'll make an exception.

99
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,160
Follow me closely.

100
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:08,560
There are many restrictions in the sect.

101
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:10,560
If you enter one of them,

102
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,080
I won't save you.

103
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,800
Thank you Senior !

104
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:24,410
As the jade slip said,

105
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:27,080
the spiritual energy is very dense here.

106
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:29,200
Using so much spiritual energy

107
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,920
for thousands of outer disciples

108
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:34,200
is truly extravagant.

109
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,400
It's exactly what I need.

110
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,040
Brother Chang.

111
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,560
Brother Chang !

112
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:45,210
Chang Dawei
Soul Refining Sect's outer sect Elder
Early stage Core Formation

113
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,520
I'm here,

114
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,120
what are you shouting for ?

115
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:49,360
This is a junior I met on the way.

116
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:53,560
Brother Chang, how about you take him as an outer disciple ?

117
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,560
Since Hong Maozi asked personally,

118
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,480
how could I refuse ?

119
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,680
I leave him to you then.

120
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,240
This time

121
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:06,360
I gathered 100 vengeful souls.

122
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:10,120
I'll add them to my Soul Flag and make one a primary soul.

123
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,000
Once I'm done,

124
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,080
I'll come to drink with you.

125
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:22,480
Hong Maozi never acts without benefit,

126
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,760
what did you give him ?

127
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,680
A sword

128
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:29,120
that a Senior gave me.

129
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,880
Since that's the case,

130
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:36,600
cave 1090 shall be yours.

131
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:40,280
One mid quality spirit stone per year.

132
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,120
This cave has little spiritual energy,

133
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,920
its vein looks depleted.

134
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:46,880
Senior,

135
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:49,880
may I switch to a better cave ?

136
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:53,280
Cultivators mustn't be greedy.

137
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,920
Your foundation

138
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,760
is unstable.

139
00:07:56,960 --> 00:08:00,290
If you keep this up, you will never reach Core Formation.

140
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,170
May Junior ask one more thing ?

141
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,920
What's this Soul Flag Hong Maozi mentioned ?

142
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,240
Do you know

143
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:13,680
that our sect has only 100 inner disciples ?

144
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:17,680
Yet it still can rival other sects of the country of Pilu.

145
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,320
That's because of Soul Flags.

146
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,360
What are they ?

147
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,400
The Soul Flags

148
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,880
are our sect's unique artifacts.

149
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:29,400
Their secrets are only for inner disciples.

150
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,360
Back then,

151
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,680
I fought my way into the inner sect.

152
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,520
But since I stayed too long at early Core Formation,

153
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:38,120
I lost my status

154
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,680
and became an outer sect elder.

155
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,440
Could Senior share some insights ?

156
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:48,240
You're not qualified yet.

157
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:52,760
Outer disciples compete every 3 years.

158
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,000
A single one gets to enter the inner sect.

159
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,560
If you want to know,

160
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,120
try yourself.

161
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:00,960
Junior apologizes.

162
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,720
What's your name ?

163
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,680
Disciple's name is Qian Mu.

164
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:06,480
Enough,

165
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,560
follow me.

166
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,200
I looked everywhere

167
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:28,080
but couldn't find a trace of his aura.

168
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,520
What happened to him ?

169
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:39,490
Outer disciples cave 803
Soul Refining Sect

170
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:40,160
The lower the cave number,

171
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,080
the more spiritual energy it has.

172
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,920
For Hong Maozi's sake,

173
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:46,880
I gave you a Spirit Vein location.

174
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,080
Thank you Senior,

175
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,880
Junior will repay you.

176
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:00,880
Tens of thousands of outer disciples...

177
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,880
But only one can enter the inner sect.

178
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:08,160
Yet the sect spends vast resources on outers...

179
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:10,800
What's their true purpose ?

180
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:15,200
Surely not just helping disciples cultivate.

181
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,000
A Spirit Vein ?

182
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:31,010
Crystal Kun Stone

183
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:36,290
So they use a Crystal Kun Stone to gather energy

184
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,880
and a spirit gathering formation to contain it.

185
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:43,080
A clever way to make a false Spirit Vein.

186
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,400
But if I break the restriction

187
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:48,360
and use the Crystal Kun Stone directly,

188
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:52,250
I should be able to reach Late stage Foundation Establishment.

189
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:54,480
With my current cultivation,

190
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,600
breaking the restriction

191
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,760
will be difficult.

192
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:01,040
But it's worth trying.

193
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,360
Break !

194
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,210
Break !

195
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,970
Foundation Establishment

196
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,970
Peak Late stage

197
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:57,440
This cave's spiritual energy is depleted...

198
00:12:27,520 --> 00:12:29,120
I wonder

199
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,480
how Wan'er is doing...

200
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,800
Only 7 years left...

201
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,560
I have to speed up.

202
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,890
I will find a true Spirit Vein

203
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,880
to fully break the Tea Domain

204
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,480
and sealing mark.

205
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:56,250
Outer disciples cave 743
Soul Refining Sect

206
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,440
This cave

207
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:02,280
must be the closest to the true Spirit Vein.

208
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,400
But it's occupied...

209
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,560
Qian Mu

210
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,640
Senior

211
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:15,120
Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment !

212
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:17,560
He has mediocre talent

213
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,600
but in just 3 months

214
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:22,370
he leaped from Early to Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

215
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:25,760
He either has a heaven defying artifact

216
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:29,480
or his cultivation method is very profound !

217
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,200
I'm afraid the next time we meet,

218
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:35,080
I'll have to call you fellow cultivator.

219
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,000
Since my Origin Soul collapsed,

220
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,960
I can't conceal my cultivation.

221
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:42,320
Since this Core Formation cultivator noticed,

222
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,650
he's going to be troublesome to deal with...

223
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:48,280
This land is blessed,

224
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:49,760
Junior cultivated day and night

225
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:51,480
and got lucky in breakthroughs.

226
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:55,680
If you reach Core Formation,

227
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:58,000
you will have a good chance to win

228
00:13:57,840 --> 00:14:00,480
the sect competition in 3 months.

229
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:04,000
If you enter the inner sect,

230
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:06,520
remember to visit me sometimes.

231
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:08,930
By the way,

232
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,600
let me warn you.

233
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:14,160
The sect competition only has one rule:

234
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,800
winner takes all.

235
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,880
As long as you win,

236
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:20,120
life or death doesn't matter.

237
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:22,450
Thank you Senior for the advice.

238
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:34,760
If I can learn Qian Mu's cultivation method,

239
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:37,890
I may be able to re-enter the inner sect !

240
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,840
Weird...

241
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:50,080
Why did he leave the door open ?

242
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:52,480
He's just a mere Foundation Establishment,

243
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:54,480
killing him will be easy.

244
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,080
So you have come.

245
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,280
Qian Mu,

246
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:09,640
hand over your cultivation secrets !

247
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,360
And if I refuse ?

248
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,600
You have no choice !

249
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,160
The sect doesn't care

250
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:17,280
about the lives of outer disciples.

251
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:18,680
If you hand it over,

252
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,880
I will spare you.

253
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Otherwise...

254
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:37,280
You really have good artifacts !

255
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:40,480
But they'll all be mine today !

256
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,480
What is this thing !?

257
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:58,280
You can't kill me,

258
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,120
I'm an outer sect elder !

259
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,120
The sect doesn't care

260
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:04,960
about the lives of outer disciples.

261
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,600
There's no way

262
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,360
you're just at Foundation Establishment...

263
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:11,120
Who exactly are you !?

264
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,600
You're not worthy

265
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:14,760
to know who I am.

266
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:36,880
Who ?

267
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:42,640
Sen...

268
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:43,680
Senior !

269
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,370
Seal !

270
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:58,650
Spirit Vein mine
Soul Refining Sect

271
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,320
A Spirit Vein mine...

272
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:10,810
The spiritual energy here is so dense

273
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,720
that it creates spirit stones naturally.

274
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,600
It's the perfect place

275
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:17,680
for breaking the seal.

276
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,080
Fall !

277
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,280
I'm going all out !

278
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,080
Again !

279
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,280
